{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape Roomble is a first-person social deduction where you solve puzzles online with other 3-11 players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch out for trappers and their malicious schemes if you want to escape this ancient pyramid alive.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE AGENTS:</strong> Solve Puzles while you watch out so no one traps you puzzle sending you flying to your death.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/AGENT_PUZZLE_GIF-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Win by solving all the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Communicate with each other to extinguish the Crisis schemed by the Trapper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Call emergency meetings to discuss and Vote to eject suspected Trappers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE TRAPPER:</strong> Use secret passages to prey on your victims, hide traps among their precious puzzle key items, and see them go BOOM! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/TRAPPER_VENTING-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Kill Agents by trapping key items before they use them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Help with the puzzles just enough to pass as a dutiful Agent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Sneak through secret passages, spy, prey and scheme. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unleash a Crisis to create an extra dose of chaos among Agents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/TRAPPER_CRISIS_GIF-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EMERGENCY MEETING:</strong> Vote to get rid of your enemy - Meetings are a great place for unmasking the traitors, and also for framing the agents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/EMERGENCY_MEETING_GIF-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We recommend to Play with friends. Rooms have been tested with up to 12 people.<br>Customize your character and join with friends to work-out puzzles together. The more the merrier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/GRUPO_DISFRAZADO_GIF-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Built-in Voice Chat with Proximity Chat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Matchmaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2 Character roles. The Trapper and the Agent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A lot of cosmetics to personalize your Exolotl with Hats, Chest pieces, Skirts, Pants... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Seasonal Content with its own Season Pass. Current season is S1 Ancient Egypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COSMETICS:\u00a0</strong>Customize your Exolotl with Reptile Skin Patterns, fun Tops and Bottoms and Full body disguises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/COSMETICOS_Gif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our community Discord to submit feedback and ideas, ask questions and find groups to play with!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/JOIN_OUR_DISCORD_COMMUNNITY.png?t=1750093394\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2521370?t=1750093394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2521370?t=1750093394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/81ad97eaa4ce0cda313b1985fe81323693b076d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750093394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/81ad97eaa4ce0cda313b1985fe81323693b076d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750093394","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape Roomble is a first-person social deduction where you solve puzzles online with other 3-11 players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch out for trappers and their malicious schemes if you want to escape this ancient pyramid alive.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE AGENTS:</strong> Solve Puzles while you watch out so no one traps you puzzle sending you flying to your death.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/AGENT_PUZZLE_GIF-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750093394\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Win by solving all the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Communicate with each other to extinguish the Crisis schemed by the Trapper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Call emergency meetings to discuss and Vote to eject suspected Trappers.</p><p class=\"bb_para